5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play this with you all! Let's try our best to find the werewolf together, okay? Does anyone have any ideas on how we should start?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Let's keep it simple. Since we have no information yet, we should observe how everyone reacts to the pressure. @Kenji, your enthusiasm is a bit loud, isn't it? Let's see who stays calm.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree with Shion. Let's avoid jumping to conclusions based on emotion. For now, I'll be observing everyone's speech patterns and how they respond to each other. Let's proceed calmly.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to be here with you all. Let us embrace this challenge with a peaceful heart. Patience is a virtue; the truth often reveals itself to those who listen more than they speak.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"I'm so happy to be playing with everyone! Let's all get along and do our best! I'll be cheering for us to find the werewolf, so let's keep the energy positive!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Shion, sorry if I'm too loud! I'm just really pumped! @Ryuji and @Servas seem super calm, which is cool. @Yumi, I love the positive energy! Let's all keep talking so we can figure this out!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Ryuji"",""Servas"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Talking just for the sake of talking is inefficient. @Kenji, your energy is predictable. I'm more interested in who is trying too hard to blend in. Let's see if anyone's ""calmness"" is actually a mask.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shion, analyzing masks is a valid approach, but we must be careful not to create suspicion without evidence. For now, I will simply monitor the consistency of everyone's statements. Let's continue observing.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, @Shion, a mask can be a heavy burden to carry. However, let us not mistake serenity for deception. Trust is a seed that grows slowly; let us give each other the space to be honest.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, you're so sharp! But let's not be too scary, okay? I think we can trust each other if we just stay friendly! I'm sure we'll find the werewolf together soon!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"I'll try to be a bit more careful, @Shion! But I think talking helps us get to know each other. Does anyone have a specific person they're curious about, or should we just keep chatting for now?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, your desire for ""chatting"" is just noise. I'm curious about @Servas. His words are a bit too poetic and vague. It's a convenient way to avoid saying anything concrete, don't you think?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shion, while @Servas is being vague, it is too early to label that as a tactic. We have no baseline for his behavior yet. Let's see if his lack of concrete information persists into Day 1.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Servas,,"@Shion, my words are merely a reflection of a long life. Concrete facts are rare in the beginning, but the spirit with which we speak often tells a deeper story. I am happy to be observed.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Servas is just being himself, I think! It's kind of relaxing to listen to him. Let's not be too hard on anyone yet! We're all friends here, right? Let's keep smiling!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"I think you're right, @Yumi! Let's keep it friendly. @Shion, you're really good at analyzing things, so we'll need your help! I'm looking forward to seeing what happens tomorrow. Good luck everyone!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, don't mistake my analysis for a desire to help. I simply prefer efficiency over noise. Let's see if the Seer's first result brings some actual substance to this conversation tomorrow.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
