35,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Everyone, good morning! I have some really important news. I'm the Seer, and I checked on @Shion last night... and it turns out Shion is the werewolf! We found them already!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, that was far too fast. A Seer revealing themselves and their result immediately is a desperate move. Are you the real Seer, or just a Werewolf trying to frame me?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Kenji, claiming the Seer role and identifying the Werewolf in the first turn is an aggressive strategy. It is either a bold truth or a calculated lie. @Shion, your reaction is expected. I need more evidence.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, your revelation is like a sudden storm in a quiet forest. It brings clarity, yet also great turbulence. @Shion, please tell us your thoughts calmly so we may weigh the truth.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"@Kenji, you're the Seer?! That's amazing! But @Shion is the werewolf? I can't believe it! Are you sure, Kenji? I really hope we're getting this right so everyone stays safe!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm absolutely sure, @Yumi! I checked @Shion and the result was clear. @Shion, I'm not lying! I just wanted to tell everyone right away so we could stop the werewolf before anyone gets hurt!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, your eagerness is almost touching. However, a real Seer would likely be more cautious about their own survival. By exposing yourself immediately, you've made yourself the perfect target for the night. It's a clumsy bluff.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Kenji, your logic is that speed prevents casualties, but @Shion's point about your survival is logically sound. If you are the Seer, you have just guaranteed your death tonight. Why prioritize speed over your own longevity?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Ryuji, your logic is sound, yet some souls value the safety of the collective over their own. @Kenji, your courage is admirable, but please tell us why you chose such a perilous path.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Kenji, you're so brave for putting yourself in danger to protect us! But @Shion is right that it's a bit scary. I really want to believe you, Kenji! What do you think, everyone?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I just couldn't stand the thought of someone getting hurt tonight! I know it's risky for me, but if we get the werewolf now, we all win! Please believe me, I'm telling the truth!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, your ""self-sacrifice"" is a convenient narrative. If you're the Werewolf, you've just attempted to eliminate me in one move. @Ryuji, @Servas, look at the lack of logic here. A clumsy lie wrapped in emotion is still a lie.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Ryuji"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shion, your argument is consistent, but @Kenji's behavior is an outlier. While his lack of caution is illogical for a Seer, it is also a high-risk play for a Werewolf. I am still weighing the probability of both scenarios.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Shion, your mind is as sharp as a blade, but remember that not all hearts follow the path of logic. @Kenji, your passion is clear. Let us consider if this haste is a shield or a sword.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, you're being so mean to Kenji! He's just trying to help us! I think it's really sweet that he cares so much about our safety. I want to trust him! Let's believe in Kenji!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not trying to be a hero, I just really want us all to be safe! @Shion, you can call me clumsy, but the truth doesn't change! Please, everyone, let's vote for Shion and win this!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, your desperation is showing. You're pleading with emotion because you have no logic to support this farce. @Ryuji, @Servas, don't let a loud voice dictate the truth. Voting for me based on a bluff is a fatal mistake.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Ryuji"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Kenji, your emotional appeal is noted, but @Shion's point about the Seer's survival remains a significant logical gap. However, if @Shion is the Werewolf, this is the most efficient way to win. I will vote based on the risk.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Servas,,"The path we choose today will shape our tomorrow. While logic warns us of the risk, the heart feels @Kenji's sincerity. Let us move forward with courage and hope for the best. I shall cast my vote.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I really believe in Kenji! He's been so honest and energetic from the start, and he's risking everything for us! I can't just ignore that kindness. Let's trust him and vote for Shion!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
